<head>
<no>1</no><heading guid="_10d4dc0c-ae4a-405d-b6ff-db54ffb7d6fe"
id="sec.1-he"><b>Name of Act</b></heading></head>
<block><txt break.before="1">This Act is the <legref refid="act-2010-076"
jurisd="NSW" type="act" check="unknown"><name emphasis="yes"><i>Industrial
Relations Advisory Council Act
2010</i></name></legref>.</txt></block></level>


<level type="clause" id="sec.2">
<parentattributes>
<attrib name="affected.by.uncommenced" value="0"></attrib>
<attrib name="spent.amends" value="0"></attrib>
<attrib name="provision.type" value="other"></attrib>
<attrib name="guid" value="_fd537cf6-06b7-4b3f-a21e-e8db59054ab8"></attrib>
<attrib name="id" value="sec.2"></attrib></parentattributes>

<head>
<no>2</no><heading guid="_49890910-7d2b-420a-87d2-1ccf9cb01c7d"
id="sec.2-he"><b>Commencement</b></heading></head>
<block><txt break.before="1">This Act commences on the date of assent to this
Act.</txt></block></level>


<level type="clause" id="sec.3">
<parentattributes>
<attrib name="affected.by.uncommenced" value="0"></attrib>
<attrib name="spent.amends" value="0"></attrib>
<attrib name="provision.type" value="other"></attrib>
<attrib name="guid" value="_535db100-daba-481e-b0ce-ad0ffae94318"></attrib>
<attrib name="id" value="sec.3"></attrib></parentattributes>

<head>
<no>3</no><heading guid="_4bea7eb6-9869-487e-ab34-96a0a73f31aa"
id="sec.3-he"><b>Definitions</b></heading></head>
<block><txt break.before="1">In this Act&#8212;</txt>
<deflist>
<block><txt break.before="1"><defterm type="definition"
guid="_36b02ffc-1b7c-4ce9-8229-854e911d71b4"
id="def.appointedmember"><b><i>appointed member</i></b></defterm> means a
member referred to in section 6 (1) (d).</txt></block>
<block><txt break.before="1"><defterm type="definition"
guid="_5de8121f-3d4b-4d95-8a4d-1025e5cca3c6"
id="def.Chairperson"><b><i>Chairperson</i></b></defterm> means the Chairperson
of the Council.</txt></block>
<block><txt break.before="1"><defterm type="definition"
guid="_0909f2fb-81e3-45a3-9693-55e6b4273d33"
id="def.Council"><b><i>Council</i></b></defterm> means the Industrial
Relations Advisory Council established under this Act.</txt></block>
<block><txt break.before="1"><defterm type="definition"
guid="_a2017551-c503-494b-847f-3093d1a8ed3b"
id="def.exercise"><b><i>exercise</i></b></defterm> a function includes perform
a duty.</txt></block>
<block><txt break.before="1"><defterm type="definition"
guid="_798c7f34-bdca-4ecf-bd2b-81d45784939e"
id="def.function"><b><i>function</i></b></defterm> includes a power, authority
or duty.</txt></block>
<block><txt break.before="1"><defterm type="definition"
guid="_fd927f2b-c1b0-4381-bde1-d8e08a030c4b"
id="def.member"><b><i>member</i></b></defterm> means a member of the
Council.</txt></block></deflist>
</block></level>


<level type="clause" id="sec.4">
<parentattributes>
<attrib name="affected.by.uncommenced" value="0"></attrib>
<attrib name="spent.amends" value="0"></attrib>
<attrib name="provision.type" value="other"></attrib>
<attrib name="guid" value="_23298099-b4cd-4cd5-9a52-456390853fc9"></attrib>
<attrib name="id" value="sec.4"></attrib></parentattributes>

<head>
<no>4</no><heading guid="_af34926e-1aa7-403c-b4ff-91e456907562"
id="sec.4-he"><b>Object of Act</b></heading></head>
<block><txt break.before="1">The object of this Act is to establish the
Industrial Relations Advisory Council to provide, in the public interest, a
regular and organised means by which representatives of the Government,
employers and employees, and other persons invited by the Minister, may
consult together on industrial matters of State-wide
concern.</txt></block></level>
</level>


<level type="part" id="pt.2">
<parentattributes>
<attrib name="affected.by.uncommenced" value="0"></attrib>
<attrib name="guid" value="_719c65c1-9a39-4abe-85bc-d233c707a1a3"></attrib>
<attrib name="id" value="pt.2"></attrib></parentattributes>

<head>
<no><b>Part 2</b></no><heading guid="_75b42e71-0ec6-42ca-8706-7b1957b9a1a2"
id="pt.2-he"><b>Industrial Relations Advisory Council</b></heading></head>

<level type="clause" id="sec.5">
<parentattributes>
<attrib name="affected.by.uncommenced" value="0"></attrib>
<attrib name="spent.amends" value="0"></attrib>
<attrib name="provision.type" value="other"></attrib>
<attrib name="guid" value="_7798c1f8-41c7-43f8-bad4-aeb3a5cf1dc2"></attrib>
<attrib name="id" value="sec.5"></attrib></parentattributes>

<head>
<no>5</no><heading guid="_a171ff19-6149-49a5-b550-915b113672e8"
id="sec.5-he"><b>Establishment of Council</b></heading></head>
<block><txt break.before="1">There is established by this Act an Industrial
Relations Advisory Council.</txt></block></level>


<level type="clause" id="sec.6">
<parentattributes>
<attrib name="affected.by.uncommenced" value="0"></attrib>
<attrib name="spent.amends" value="0"></attrib>
<attrib name="provision.type" value="other"></attrib>
<attrib name="guid" value="_e34110aa-1378-4da1-8395-94852b3b2f5a"></attrib>
<attrib name="id" value="sec.6"></attrib></parentattributes>

<head>
<no>6</no><heading guid="_d91252e8-3617-4cd4-baef-5e8fa21d374e"
id="sec.6-he"><b>Membership of Council</b></heading></head>

<tier type="subclause" id="sec.6-ssec.1">
<parentattributes>
<attrib name="affected.by.uncommenced" value="0"></attrib>
<attrib name="provision.type" value="other"></attrib>
<attrib name="guid" value="_05aaefdd-33a5-469f-bf1d-8fa832c0f1ea"></attrib>
<attrib name="id" value="sec.6-ssec.1"></attrib></parentattributes>

<head>
<no>(1)</no></head>
<block><txt break.before="1">The Council is to consist of&#8212;</txt>
<list number.type="default" unnumbered.indent="0">
<li provision.type="other" affected.by.uncommenced="0"
guid="_f3766269-01d7-4cfb-8a35-12c1e41e7084" id="sec.6-ssec.1-para1.a">
<no>(a)</no>
<block><txt break.before="1">the Minister, who is to be the Chairperson,
and</txt></block></li>
<li provision.type="other" affected.by.uncommenced="0"
guid="_f50645df-babf-42c5-8da9-bf193da8a3cf" id="sec.6-ssec.1-para1.b">
<no>(b)</no>
<block><txt break.before="1">the Secretary of the Premier&#8217;s Department,
and</txt></block></li>
<li provision.type="other" affected.by.uncommenced="0"
guid="_32485733-5bd6-4985-b6b9-c72eb0274b1d" id="sec.6-ssec.1-para1.c"
status="repealed">
<no>(c)</no>
<repealed><repealedtxt></repealedtxt></repealed>
</li>
<li provision.type="other" affected.by.uncommenced="0"
guid="_7aa7cd1d-5196-4e5d-b75e-20a7c15f7dd5" id="sec.6-ssec.1-para1.d">
<no>(d)</no>
<block><txt break.before="1">the following members appointed by the
Minister&#8212;</txt>
<list number.type="default" unnumbered.indent="0">
<li provision.type="other" affected.by.uncommenced="0"
guid="_39c40b5f-6085-400a-b65e-e2e132d5f039"
id="sec.6-ssec.1-para1.d-para2.i">
<no>(i)</no>
<block><txt break.before="1">8 members nominated by Unions
NSW,</txt></block></li>
<li provision.type="other" affected.by.uncommenced="0"
guid="_b3912c7c-98a2-42e4-8a6b-1e6a4218d408"
id="sec.6-ssec.1-para1.d-para2.ii">
<no>(ii)</no>
<block><txt break.before="1">one member nominated by the NSW Business
Chamber,</txt></block></li>
<li provision.type="other" affected.by.uncommenced="0"
guid="_e6a794a5-05cf-4e8d-9fb3-1b3b70a0a5a2"
id="sec.6-ssec.1-para1.d-para2.iii">
<no>(iii)</no>
<block><txt break.before="1">one member nominated by the Australian Industry
Group (NSW Branch),</txt></block></li>
<li provision.type="other" affected.by.uncommenced="0"
guid="_507c87e2-09e0-4e40-b804-65646150f62c"
id="sec.6-ssec.1-para1.d-para2.iv">
<no>(iv)</no>
<block><txt break.before="1">one member nominated by the Australian Federation
of Employers and Industries,</txt></block></li>
<li provision.type="other" affected.by.uncommenced="0"
guid="_cf815d09-4058-4a50-86d4-5504d459c729"
id="sec.6-ssec.1-para1.d-para2.v">
<no>(v)</no>
<block><txt break.before="1">one member nominated by the Local Government and
Shires Association of New South Wales,</txt></block></li>
<li provision.type="other" affected.by.uncommenced="0"
guid="_2ff1f587-9870-4644-aca8-e603cc135d0b"
id="sec.6-ssec.1-para1.d-para2.vi">
<no>(vi)</no>
<block><txt break.before="1">one member nominated by the Catholic Commission
for Employment Relations,</txt></block></li>
<li provision.type="other" affected.by.uncommenced="0"
guid="_0a5a5e4a-251a-4a73-8274-b5122b966ef8"
id="sec.6-ssec.1-para1.d-para2.vii">
<no>(vii)</no>
<block><txt break.before="1">one member nominated by the Law Society of New
South Wales,</txt></block></li>
<li provision.type="other" affected.by.uncommenced="0"
guid="_39d80b09-af07-4641-bc8a-a4dad58afb4c"
id="sec.6-ssec.1-para1.d-para2.viii">
<no>(viii)</no>
<block><txt break.before="1">one member nominated by the Bar Association of
New South Wales,</txt></block></li>
<li provision.type="other" affected.by.uncommenced="0"
guid="_8cff6625-7457-44f0-9a32-022131f4c976"
id="sec.6-ssec.1-para1.d-para2.ix">
<no>(ix)</no>
<block><txt break.before="1">one member nominated by the Master Builders
Association of New South Wales.</txt></block></li></list>
</block></li></list>
</block></tier>


<tier type="subclause" id="sec.6-ssec.2">
<parentattributes>
<attrib name="affected.by.uncommenced" value="0"></attrib>
<attrib name="provision.type" value="other"></attrib>
<attrib name="guid" value="_42911a3c-697a-424c-b0b6-75dd5d16cc5d"></attrib>
<attrib name="id" value="sec.6-ssec.2"></attrib></parentattributes>

<head>
<no>(2)</no></head>
<block><txt break.before="1">Nothing in this section prevents the Minister
from inviting or authorising any other person to attend, or participate in, a
meeting of the Council.</txt></block></tier>


<tier type="subclause" id="sec.6-ssec.3">
<parentattributes>
<attrib name="affected.by.uncommenced" value="0"></attrib>
<attrib name="provision.type" value="other"></attrib>
<attrib name="guid" value="_c14c0cc0-998d-4953-b43c-67d783f25500"></attrib>
<attrib name="id" value="sec.6-ssec.3"></attrib></parentattributes>

<head>
<no>(3)</no></head>
<block><txt break.before="1">Schedule 1 contains provisions relating to
members of the Council.</txt></block></tier>


<content type="historynote"><txt break.before="1"><b>s 6:</b> Am 2013 No 111,
Sch 2.9; 2022 No 59, Sch 2.22[1] [2]; 2023 No 35, Sch 4.21.</txt></content>
</level>


<level type="clause" id="sec.7">
<parentattributes>
<attrib name="affected.by.uncommenced" value="0"></attrib>
<attrib name="spent.amends" value="0"></attrib>
<attrib name="provision.type" value="other"></attrib>
<attrib name="guid" value="_9874c93d-47e7-454d-8817-beee0d1fc947"></attrib>
<attrib name="id" value="sec.7"></attrib></parentattributes>

<head>
<no>7</no><heading guid="_e39ff41d-8cc2-4436-89f8-f627dd8c1fc5"
id="sec.7-he"><b>Functions of Council</b></heading></head>
<block><txt break.before="1">The functions of the Council are as
follows&#8212;</txt>
<list number.type="default" unnumbered.indent="0">
<li provision.type="other" affected.by.uncommenced="0"
guid="_f8996a53-b3d0-4bfb-b949-acf2c81ab66e" id="sec.7-para1.a">
<no>(a)</no>
<block><txt break.before="1">to assist the Minister in formulating, and to
advise the Minister on implementing, policies affecting industrial relations
and employment in the State,</txt></block></li>
<li provision.type="other" affected.by.uncommenced="0"
guid="_add79058-7a0b-46b0-b5ff-cc356cc0cdd8" id="sec.7-para1.b">
<no>(b)</no>
<block><txt break.before="1">to advise the Minister on legislative proposals
of industrial significance,</txt></block></li>
<li provision.type="other" affected.by.uncommenced="0"
guid="_8fb57f72-5ec5-4d1e-832f-ff07949ffdf6" id="sec.7-para1.c">
<no>(c)</no>
<block><txt break.before="1">to consider matters referred to the Council by
the Minister or members of the Council.</txt></block></li></list>
</block></level>


<level type="clause" id="sec.8">
<parentattributes>
<attrib name="affected.by.uncommenced" value="0"></attrib>
<attrib name="spent.amends" value="0"></attrib>
<attrib name="provision.type" value="other"></attrib>
<attrib name="guid" value="_c198100d-a4e1-4cc7-b205-aa20dffc6ce5"></attrib>
<attrib name="id" value="sec.8"></attrib></parentattributes>

<head>
<no>8</no><heading guid="_7bc862d4-5992-4685-a684-2e88334fae96"
id="sec.8-he"><b>Committees of Council</b></heading></head>

<tier type="subclause" id="sec.8-ssec.1">
<parentattributes>
<attrib name="affected.by.uncommenced" value="0"></attrib>
<attrib name="provision.type" value="other"></attrib>
<attrib name="guid" value="_b112cd5a-fbe1-4055-a858-79a6e4425ac0"></attrib>
<attrib name="id" value="sec.8-ssec.1"></attrib></parentattributes>

<head>
<no>(1)</no></head>
<block><txt break.before="1">The Council may establish committees for
specified purposes to assist it in connection with the exercise of its
functions.</txt></block></tier>


<tier type="subclause" id="sec.8-ssec.2">
<parentattributes>
<attrib name="affected.by.uncommenced" value="0"></attrib>
<attrib name="provision.type" value="other"></attrib>
<attrib name="guid" value="_6a91b7ab-8e31-48e6-8ca0-66ca79e98cc0"></attrib>
<attrib name="id" value="sec.8-ssec.2"></attrib></parentattributes>

<head>
<no>(2)</no></head>
<block><txt break.before="1">A committee must include at least one member of
the Council.</txt></block></tier>


<tier type="subclause" id="sec.8-ssec.3">
<parentattributes>
<attrib name="affected.by.uncommenced" value="0"></attrib>
<attrib name="provision.type" value="other"></attrib>
<attrib name="guid" value="_bccbfe9f-1cd8-407c-add0-26c5823ce102"></attrib>
<attrib name="id" value="sec.8-ssec.3"></attrib></parentattributes>

<head>
<no>(3)</no></head>
<block><txt break.before="1">The procedure for the calling of meetings of a
committee and for the conduct of business at those meetings is to be
determined by the Council or, subject to any determination of the Council, by
the committee.</txt></block></tier>
</level>


<level type="clause" id="sec.9">
<parentattributes>
<attrib name="affected.by.uncommenced" value="0"></attrib>
<attrib name="spent.amends" value="0"></attrib>
<attrib name="provision.type" value="other"></attrib>
<attrib name="guid" value="_bb8ff1d5-1cc3-45c9-b406-a55f5eec7346"></attrib>
<attrib name="id" value="sec.9"></attrib></parentattributes>

<head>
<no>9</no><heading guid="_af78c9db-6f24-4cc0-b86e-6de42299f72f"
id="sec.9-he"><b>Confidentiality</b></heading></head>

<tier type="subclause" id="sec.9-ssec.1">
<parentattributes>
<attrib name="affected.by.uncommenced" value="0"></attrib>
<attrib name="provision.type" value="other"></attrib>
<attrib name="guid" value="_961b7d0f-5fca-42c2-9942-c9ca97dfca10"></attrib>
<attrib name="id" value="sec.9-ssec.1"></attrib></parentattributes>

<head>
<no>(1)</no></head>
<block><txt break.before="1">The views expressed by individual members of the
Council (as distinct from the views or decision of the Council as a whole)
must be kept confidential.</txt></block></tier>


<tier type="subclause" id="sec.9-ssec.2">
<parentattributes>
<attrib name="affected.by.uncommenced" value="0"></attrib>
<attrib name="provision.type" value="other"></attrib>
<attrib name="guid" value="_6d7d2e2f-db5e-4018-a73f-444d103bab8f"></attrib>
<attrib name="id" value="sec.9-ssec.2"></attrib></parentattributes>

<head>
<no>(2)</no></head>
<block><txt break.before="1">However, this section does not prevent an
appointed member from reporting to the body on whose nomination the member was
appointed on the views expressed at a meeting of the
Council.</txt></block></tier>


<tier type="subclause" id="sec.9-ssec.3">
<parentattributes>
<attrib name="affected.by.uncommenced" value="0"></attrib>
<attrib name="provision.type" value="other"></attrib>
<attrib name="guid" value="_7f80b360-a1e7-47a7-ac6f-8fe1a1840253"></attrib>
<attrib name="id" value="sec.9-ssec.3"></attrib></parentattributes>

<head>
<no>(3)</no></head>
<block><txt break.before="1">There must be no public announcement of a view or
decision reached by the Council unless the Council resolves that the
announcement should be made.</txt></block></tier>


<tier type="subclause" id="sec.9-ssec.4">
<parentattributes>
<attrib name="affected.by.uncommenced" value="0"></attrib>
<attrib name="provision.type" value="other"></attrib>
<attrib name="guid" value="_663a1641-0b3e-4864-b5f4-b2e159dff6a1"></attrib>
<attrib name="id" value="sec.9-ssec.4"></attrib></parentattributes>

<head>
<no>(4)</no></head>
<block><txt break.before="1">Without limiting the generality of clause 3 (3)
of Schedule 1, the Minister may remove an appointed member from office if the
member contravenes this section.</txt></block></tier>
</level>
</level>


<level type="part" id="pt.3">
<parentattributes>
<attrib name="affected.by.uncommenced" value="0"></attrib>
<attrib name="guid" value="_2415120d-d73d-4b35-8118-815136438f25"></attrib>
<attrib name="id" value="pt.3"></attrib></parentattributes>

<head>
<no><b>Part 3</b></no><heading guid="_ede9a598-a340-4908-b6f1-b69991e1c588"
id="pt.3-he"><b>Miscellaneous</b></heading></head>

<level type="clause" id="sec.10">
<parentattributes>
<attrib name="affected.by.uncommenced" value="0"></attrib>
<attrib name="spent.amends" value="0"></attrib>
<attrib name="provision.type" value="other"></attrib>
<attrib name="guid" value="_39d5ff46-8bdb-49b7-8622-c835a19e1dd6"></attrib>
<attrib name="id" value="sec.10"></attrib></parentattributes>

<head>
<no>10</no><heading guid="_70009cc1-9f61-46f2-9297-7f211b126783"
id="sec.10-he"><b>Regulations</b></heading></head>
<block><txt break.before="1">The Governor may make regulations, not
inconsistent with this Act, for or with respect to any matter that by this Act
is required or permitted to be prescribed or that is necessary or convenient
to be prescribed for carrying out or giving effect to this
Act.</txt></block></level>


<level type="clause" id="sec.11">
<parentattributes>
<attrib name="affected.by.uncommenced" value="0"></attrib>
<attrib name="spent.amends" value="0"></attrib>
<attrib name="provision.type" value="other"></attrib>
<attrib name="guid" value="_4c15c4d4-1172-4ca4-96c1-ade80a19f4d6"></attrib>
<attrib name="id" value="sec.11"></attrib></parentattributes>

<head>
<no>11</no><heading guid="_a49800d5-6ce0-4c6f-bb07-cdd5dbddc713"
id="sec.11-he"><b>Review of Act</b></heading></head>

<tier type="subclause" id="sec.11-ssec.1">
<parentattributes>
<attrib name="affected.by.uncommenced" value="0"></attrib>
<attrib name="provision.type" value="other"></attrib>
<attrib name="guid" value="_654e2b5a-8f8f-4864-9bc9-8504b2f274d5"></attrib>
<attrib name="id" value="sec.11-ssec.1"></attrib></parentattributes>

<head>
<no>(1)</no></head>
<block><txt break.before="1">The Minister is to review this Act to determine
whether the policy objectives of the Act remain valid and whether the terms of
the Act remain appropriate for securing those
objectives.</txt></block></tier>


<tier type="subclause" id="sec.11-ssec.2">
<parentattributes>
<attrib name="affected.by.uncommenced" value="0"></attrib>
<attrib name="provision.type" value="other"></attrib>
<attrib name="guid" value="_91bb20eb-0e82-474c-b78a-f51626b9ed35"></attrib>
<attrib name="id" value="sec.11-ssec.2"></attrib></parentattributes>

<head>
<no>(2)</no></head>
<block><txt break.before="1">The review is to be undertaken as soon as
possible after the period of 5 years from the date of assent to this
Act.</txt></block></tier>


<tier type="subclause" id="sec.11-ssec.3">
<parentattributes>
<attrib name="affected.by.uncommenced" value="0"></attrib>
<attrib name="provision.type" value="other"></attrib>
<attrib name="guid" value="_678fc7ea-e33f-41f1-af5f-d5eea9817715"></attrib>
<attrib name="id" value="sec.11-ssec.3"></attrib></parentattributes>

<head>
<no>(3)</no></head>
<block><txt break.before="1">A report on the outcome of the review is to be
tabled in each House of Parliament within 12 months after the end of the
period of 5 years.</txt></block></tier>
</level>
</level>
</content>


<content type="schedules">

<level type="schedule" id="sch.1">
<parentattributes>
<attrib name="type" value="schedule"></attrib>
<attrib name="affected.by.uncommenced" value="0"></attrib>
<attrib name="spent.amends" value="0"></attrib>
<attrib name="provision.type" value="other"></attrib>
<attrib name="guid" value="_1f21c738-692c-401f-969e-146c2e952946"></attrib>
<attrib name="id" value="sch.1"></attrib></parentattributes>

<head>
<no><b>Schedule 1</b></no><heading
guid="_d36b6afe-337a-4798-9765-e94dd5fa92fe" id="sch.1-he"><b>Provisions
relating to members of Council</b></heading></head>

<content type="auto-inserted">

<level type="clause" id="sch.1-sec.1">
<parentattributes>
<attrib name="affected.by.uncommenced" value="0"></attrib>
<attrib name="spent.amends" value="0"></attrib>
<attrib name="provision.type" value="other"></attrib>
<attrib name="guid" value="_67f2d3c6-2813-4462-b172-97e669ef64f6"></attrib>
<attrib name="id" value="sch.1-sec.1"></attrib></parentattributes>

<head>
<no>1</no><heading guid="_aeb78613-9152-4377-84c9-eea6d7a81dd4"
id="sch.1-sec.1-he"><b>Deputies of members</b></heading></head>

<tier type="subclause" id="sch.1-sec.1-ssec.1">
<parentattributes>
<attrib name="affected.by.uncommenced" value="0"></attrib>
<attrib name="provision.type" value="other"></attrib>
<attrib name="guid" value="_5d554bfe-7cf7-4482-9196-f65854be03ce"></attrib>
<attrib name="id" value="sch.1-sec.1-ssec.1"></attrib></parentattributes>

<head>
<no>(1)</no></head>
<block><txt break.before="1">The Minister may, from time to time, appoint a
person to be the deputy of a member, and may revoke any such
appointment.</txt></block></tier>


<tier type="subclause" id="sch.1-sec.1-ssec.2">
<parentattributes>
<attrib name="affected.by.uncommenced" value="0"></attrib>
<attrib name="provision.type" value="other"></attrib>
<attrib name="guid" value="_6f65f372-aac8-4b4c-9705-57eb18f99cc1"></attrib>
<attrib name="id" value="sch.1-sec.1-ssec.2"></attrib></parentattributes>

<head>
<no>(2)</no></head>
<block><txt break.before="1">In the absence of a member, the member&#8217;s
deputy may, if available, act in place of the member.</txt></block></tier>


<tier type="subclause" id="sch.1-sec.1-ssec.3">
<parentattributes>
<attrib name="affected.by.uncommenced" value="0"></attrib>
<attrib name="provision.type" value="other"></attrib>
<attrib name="guid" value="_26fd45f4-1e22-4568-9b53-fb2a12bfa5cf"></attrib>
<attrib name="id" value="sch.1-sec.1-ssec.3"></attrib></parentattributes>

<head>
<no>(3)</no></head>
<block><txt break.before="1">While acting in place of a member, the deputy has
all the functions of the member and is taken to be a
member.</txt></block></tier>
</level>
</content>


<content type="auto-inserted">

<level type="clause" id="sch.1-sec.2">
<parentattributes>
<attrib name="affected.by.uncommenced" value="0"></attrib>
<attrib name="spent.amends" value="0"></attrib>
<attrib name="provision.type" value="other"></attrib>
<attrib name="guid" value="_2e0358c5-343f-4c81-ad62-8ec605314b80"></attrib>
<attrib name="id" value="sch.1-sec.2"></attrib></parentattributes>

<head>
<no>2</no><heading guid="_32bf18e7-5455-4f6d-9e30-6671d5942ae6"
id="sch.1-sec.2-he"><b>Term of office</b></heading></head>
<block><txt break.before="1">Subject to this Schedule, an appointed member
holds office for such period (not exceeding 3 years) as is specified in the
member&#8217;s instrument of appointment, and is eligible for
re-appointment.</txt></block></level>
</content>


<content type="auto-inserted">

<level type="clause" id="sch.1-sec.3">
<parentattributes>
<attrib name="affected.by.uncommenced" value="0"></attrib>
<attrib name="spent.amends" value="0"></attrib>
<attrib name="provision.type" value="other"></attrib>
<attrib name="guid" value="_35d34173-46b5-46bc-a82f-02bcd25d0b1e"></attrib>
<attrib name="id" value="sch.1-sec.3"></attrib></parentattributes>

<head>
<no>3</no><heading guid="_44ac7d0c-f9dd-4a9e-95b3-03c79717e5c5"
id="sch.1-sec.3-he"><b>Vacancy in office</b></heading></head>

<tier type="subclause" id="sch.1-sec.3-ssec.1">
<parentattributes>
<attrib name="affected.by.uncommenced" value="0"></attrib>
<attrib name="provision.type" value="other"></attrib>
<attrib name="guid" value="_8543e24b-9625-471e-80f9-572a32d5df51"></attrib>
<attrib name="id" value="sch.1-sec.3-ssec.1"></attrib></parentattributes>

<head>
<no>(1)</no></head>
<block><txt break.before="1">The office of an appointed member becomes vacant
if the member&#8212;</txt>
<list number.type="default" unnumbered.indent="0">
<li provision.type="other" affected.by.uncommenced="0"
guid="_5a87aac3-e8d0-4ad5-854d-dcbef5874854" id="sch.1-sec.3-ssec.1-para1.a">
<no>(a)</no>
<block><txt break.before="1">dies, or</txt></block></li>
<li provision.type="other" affected.by.uncommenced="0"
guid="_65ec43e3-87f1-44d7-a762-718d19875717" id="sch.1-sec.3-ssec.1-para1.b">
<no>(b)</no>
<block><txt break.before="1">completes a term of office and is not
re-appointed, or</txt></block></li>
<li provision.type="other" affected.by.uncommenced="0"
guid="_2f0d75b0-3638-472d-a9d6-521e7cea3b3c" id="sch.1-sec.3-ssec.1-para1.c">
<no>(c)</no>
<block><txt break.before="1">resigns the office by instrument in writing
addressed to the Minister, or</txt></block></li>
<li provision.type="other" affected.by.uncommenced="0"
guid="_7ac892ad-f578-40d8-881a-575af4df4113" id="sch.1-sec.3-ssec.1-para1.d">
<no>(d)</no>
<block><txt break.before="1">ceases to be the nominee of the body on whose
nomination the member was appointed, or</txt></block></li>
<li provision.type="other" affected.by.uncommenced="0"
guid="_9f80d8f1-b2c0-4efe-848f-70c0d77eaf46" id="sch.1-sec.3-ssec.1-para1.e">
<no>(e)</no>
<block><txt break.before="1">is removed from office by the Minister under this
clause, or</txt></block></li>
<li provision.type="other" affected.by.uncommenced="0"
guid="_0f5c73aa-50be-404a-a293-84506ecf99d2" id="sch.1-sec.3-ssec.1-para1.f">
<no>(f)</no>
<block><txt break.before="1">absents himself or herself from 4 consecutive
meetings of the Council of which reasonable notice has been given to the
member personally or in the ordinary course of post, unless&#8212;</txt>
<list number.type="default" unnumbered.indent="0">
<li provision.type="other" affected.by.uncommenced="0"
guid="_2492340d-f955-402a-88d4-f81307ba24dc"
id="sch.1-sec.3-ssec.1-para1.f-para2.i">
<no>(i)</no>
<block><txt break.before="1">the Council has granted the member leave to be
absent from those meetings, or</txt></block></li>
<li provision.type="other" affected.by.uncommenced="0"
guid="_e827eb5d-6fc1-4a99-b42a-67533045e589"
id="sch.1-sec.3-ssec.1-para1.f-para2.ii">
<no>(ii)</no>
<block><txt break.before="1">within 4 weeks after the last of those meetings,
the member is excused by the Council for having been absent from those
meetings, or</txt></block></li></list>
</block></li>
<li provision.type="other" affected.by.uncommenced="0"
guid="_67f5e8a3-bb55-4b2d-97df-e387ff47da82" id="sch.1-sec.3-ssec.1-para1.g">
<no>(g)</no>
<block><txt break.before="1">becomes bankrupt, applies to take benefit of any
law for the relief of bankrupt or insolvent debtors, compounds with his or her
creditors or makes an assignment of his or her remuneration for their benefit,
or</txt></block></li>
<li provision.type="other" affected.by.uncommenced="0"
guid="_e84ba721-c6da-421c-8345-af6758f46c26" id="sch.1-sec.3-ssec.1-para1.h">
<no>(h)</no>
<block><txt break.before="1">becomes a mentally incapacitated person,
or</txt></block></li>
<li provision.type="other" affected.by.uncommenced="0"
guid="_e7610c38-2e7f-425e-aef5-3208bae1f866" id="sch.1-sec.3-ssec.1-para1.i">
<no>(i)</no>
<block><txt break.before="1">is convicted in New South Wales of an offence
that is punishable by imprisonment for 12 months or more or is convicted
elsewhere than in New South Wales of an offence that, if committed in New
South Wales, would be an offence so punishable.</txt></block></li></list>
</block></tier>


<tier type="subclause" id="sch.1-sec.3-ssec.2">
<parentattributes>
<attrib name="affected.by.uncommenced" value="0"></attrib>
<attrib name="provision.type" value="other"></attrib>
<attrib name="guid" value="_4a5dec6a-7334-4c29-a685-70f39a684350"></attrib>
<attrib name="id" value="sch.1-sec.3-ssec.2"></attrib></parentattributes>

<head>
<no>(2)</no></head>
<block><txt break.before="1">A body referred to in section 6 (1) (d) may, by
instrument in writing addressed to the Minister, revoke the nomination of an
appointed member.</txt></block></tier>


<tier type="subclause" id="sch.1-sec.3-ssec.3">
<parentattributes>
<attrib name="affected.by.uncommenced" value="0"></attrib>
<attrib name="provision.type" value="other"></attrib>
<attrib name="guid" value="_8b527138-b056-4b8a-94d3-b8aeffa5e923"></attrib>
<attrib name="id" value="sch.1-sec.3-ssec.3"></attrib></parentattributes>

<head>
<no>(3)</no></head>
<block><txt break.before="1">The Minister may remove an appointed member from
office at any time.</txt></block></tier>
</level>
</content>


<content type="auto-inserted">

<level type="clause" id="sch.1-sec.4">
<parentattributes>
<attrib name="affected.by.uncommenced" value="0"></attrib>
<attrib name="spent.amends" value="0"></attrib>
<attrib name="provision.type" value="other"></attrib>
<attrib name="guid" value="_6fd9a2b9-fc5a-46fb-8b9b-9f19293e1022"></attrib>
<attrib name="id" value="sch.1-sec.4"></attrib></parentattributes>

<head>
<no>4</no><heading guid="_bf378833-b08a-4431-9048-2e1ba6848a33"
id="sch.1-sec.4-he"><b>Filling of vacancy of member</b></heading></head>
<block><txt break.before="1">If the office of an appointed member becomes
vacant, a person is, subject to this Act, to be appointed to fill the
vacancy.</txt></block></level>
</content>


<content type="auto-inserted">

<level type="clause" id="sch.1-sec.5">
<parentattributes>
<attrib name="affected.by.uncommenced" value="0"></attrib>
<attrib name="spent.amends" value="0"></attrib>
<attrib name="provision.type" value="other"></attrib>
<attrib name="guid" value="_d48fe92d-eca4-423e-95d5-2e677de89d15"></attrib>
<attrib name="id" value="sch.1-sec.5"></attrib></parentattributes>

<head>
<no>5</no><heading guid="_e7899cf7-45a1-4740-badd-fadc359115d1"
id="sch.1-sec.5-he"><b>General procedure</b></heading></head>
<block><txt break.before="1">The procedure for the calling of meetings of the
Council and for the conduct of business at those meetings is, subject to this
Act and the regulations, to be as determined by the
Council.</txt></block></level>
</content>


<content type="auto-inserted">

<level type="clause" id="sch.1-sec.6">
<parentattributes>
<attrib name="affected.by.uncommenced" value="0"></attrib>
<attrib name="spent.amends" value="0"></attrib>
<attrib name="provision.type" value="other"></attrib>
<attrib name="guid" value="_77ed233a-2de8-41d6-9176-fa28be0cc21d"></attrib>
<attrib name="id" value="sch.1-sec.6"></attrib></parentattributes>

<head>
<no>6</no><heading guid="_4ce73c5e-578b-4741-976d-81cb0bacbec2"
id="sch.1-sec.6-he"><b>Meetings of Council</b></heading></head>
<block><txt break.before="1">The Council must hold at least 2 meetings in each
calendar year.</txt></block></level>
</content>


<content type="auto-inserted">

<level type="clause" id="sch.1-sec.7">
<parentattributes>
<attrib name="affected.by.uncommenced" value="0"></attrib>
<attrib name="spent.amends" value="0"></attrib>
<attrib name="provision.type" value="other"></attrib>
<attrib name="guid" value="_10b2065c-7e25-475a-bd93-674acb40b142"></attrib>
<attrib name="id" value="sch.1-sec.7"></attrib></parentattributes>

<head>
<no>7</no><heading guid="_bb198e9b-0d30-47a6-946c-3fc1d46371c6"
id="sch.1-sec.7-he"><b>Quorum</b></heading></head>

<tier type="subclause" id="sch.1-sec.7-ssec.1">
<parentattributes>
<attrib name="affected.by.uncommenced" value="0"></attrib>
<attrib name="provision.type" value="other"></attrib>
<attrib name="guid" value="_b6fc6fad-fc3b-45ee-a6fa-c91c0996b24e"></attrib>
<attrib name="id" value="sch.1-sec.7-ssec.1"></attrib></parentattributes>

<head>
<no>(1)</no></head>
<block><txt break.before="1">Subject to subclause (2), the quorum for a
meeting of the Council is 8 of its members.</txt></block></tier>


<tier type="subclause" id="sch.1-sec.7-ssec.2">
<parentattributes>
<attrib name="affected.by.uncommenced" value="0"></attrib>
<attrib name="provision.type" value="other"></attrib>
<attrib name="guid" value="_d741b5c6-18a2-424b-8f2f-166063a17f61"></attrib>
<attrib name="id" value="sch.1-sec.7-ssec.2"></attrib></parentattributes>

<head>
<no>(2)</no></head>
<block><txt break.before="1">A quorum for the meeting of the Council must
include each of the following members or that member&#8217;s
deputy&#8212;</txt>
<list number.type="default" unnumbered.indent="0">
<li provision.type="other" affected.by.uncommenced="0"
guid="_c2702c1e-b13d-41fb-8c4f-473f9a2abaf7" id="sch.1-sec.7-ssec.2-para1.a">
<no>(a)</no>
<block><txt break.before="1">the Minister,</txt></block></li>
<li provision.type="other" affected.by.uncommenced="0"
guid="_ff656034-01e9-4487-ad04-274675324c64" id="sch.1-sec.7-ssec.2-para1.b">
<no>(b)</no>
<block><txt break.before="1">the Secretary of the Premier&#8217;s
Department.</txt></block></li>
<li provision.type="other" affected.by.uncommenced="0"
guid="_3a95ef7c-5484-4a16-aecd-8b67ee9106d7" id="sch.1-sec.7-ssec.2-para1.c"
status="repealed">
<no>(c)</no>
<repealed><repealedtxt></repealedtxt></repealed>
</li></list>
</block></tier>
</level>
</content>


<content type="historynote"><txt break.before="1"><b>sch 1:</b> Am 2022 No 59,
Sch 2.22[1] [2]; 2023 No 35, Sch 4.21.</txt></content>
</level>
</content>


